🐳 1. Docker System & Info


docker --version # Check Docker version
docker info # Get system-wide Docker info
docker system df # Show disk usage
docker system prune # Clean up unused data (images, containers, etc.)


📦 2. Image Management

docker images # List all local images
docker pull <image>:<tag> # Pull image from Docker Hub
docker build -t <name>:<tag> . # Build image from Dockerfile
docker rmi <image_id|image_name> # Remove image
docker tag <image> <repo>:<tag> # Tag image for pushing
docker push <repo>:<tag> # Push image to registry

🛠️ 3. Container Management

docker ps # List running containers
docker ps -a # List all containers
docker run -it <image> bash # Start container with interactive shell
docker run -d -p 80:80 <image> # Run in detached mode with port mapping
docker exec -it <container> bash # Exec into a running container
docker logs -f <container> # View logs (follow mode)
docker stop <container> # Stop a running container
docker start <container> # Start a stopped container
docker restart <container> # Restart container
docker rm <container> # Remove container


📂 4. Volumes & Networks

docker volume ls # List volumes
docker volume create <name> # Create a volume
docker volume rm <name> # Remove volume

docker network ls # List networks
docker network create <name> # Create network
docker network inspect <name> # Inspect network
docker network connect <net> <ctr> # Connect container to network

🔍 5. Inspection & Debugging

docker inspect <container|image> # Low-level details
docker stats # Live container resource usage
docker top <container> # Show container processes
docker diff <container> # Changes in container FS
docker history <image> # Image layer history
